  "goodToKnow": "Der Zynismus is cynicism: purer Zynismus, mit Zynismus reagieren. In German, zynisch often means callous or contemptuous of human suffering, a stronger reproach than in English: Das ist zynisch gegenüber den Opfern. Der Zyniker is a cynic. The word comes from the ancient Greek Cynics (kynikos, dog-like), like Diogenes. Pronounced tsü-NIS-mus. It has no plural."
